id: power-builder
name: Power Builder
advancement: true
prerequisite: Force Score 4+
tpCost: 2
powerBuilder: true
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Power Builder: You may conjure objects using your prowess in manipulating your life energy rather than
  your magic energy.
  –Prerequisites: Force Score 4+
  –TP Cost: 2 TP
  –Effect: When making a Use Magic Skill Check for the effects of Magical Materialization, you may use
  your Force Score instead of your Magic Score for the Use Magic Skill’s Skill Bonus.

---

# Said on the card: the Check is rolled from the sheet, with the Skill Bonus it has there.
